title: "NoisEasier: Test-Time Noise Optimization for Text-to-Video Generation"
message: "If you use this code, please cite the NoisEasier paper."
type: software
url: "https://yujiangpu20.github.io/noiseasier/"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  NoisEasier is a test-time scaling framework that improves text-to-video
  generation by optimizing latent noise with differentiable reward feedback.
keywords:
  - text-to-video generation
  - diffusion models
  - test-time optimization
